	(text "MMBT3906 inverter (E COM, base BAT54+2.2k on CLAMP) drives CG to COM once the lowest gate is below ~-1.2 V;\nMMBT3904 release (from OUTH via 5.6 V Zener) holds CG at VEE while OUTH drives."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 14 241.28 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "0cd23f88-52ce-5258-9c78-7198791a9b22")
	)
	(text "SYMMETRY: gate and Kelvin of S4a/S4b as coupled pairs of equal length (+/-10 %) from the COM_S4 star; Ron,\nRoff, Kelvin R, 10k, Zeners at each device; power sources joined only by the busbar. CLAMP LOOP: each\nAO3400A + C_VL at its device's gate-Kelvin pins, loop <= 1 nH. IC-22: milled slot between the drain\npin 1 and pins 2-4 of each TO-247-4L; DESAT string >= 2.5 mm pad gap per diode; board coated to PD1.\nMiller hold (gdrv rev 5, ngspice 1100 V / 72.4 A, 115 V/ns): die +1.41 V vs VGS(th) min 1.94 V at 175 C,\nmargin 0.53 V (rev 4 PNP: +2.14 V) - BENCH TEST (double pulse, hot, minimum-threshold devices)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 356.744 179.9 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "16f4c8e2-c126-5e4d-8cd5-847cbf7cf291")
	)
	(text "DESAT > 10.3-10.9 V (above the 10.0 V maximum trip of the -Q1 grade) -> MMBT3904 -> MMBT3906 charges BG to VEE + 10 V;\nper device AO3400A + 22R pull the gate to VEE; BG holds ~3 us (1k + FET gates)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 124.222 216.792 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "36357d6d-3157-5869-8ccb-0831d199daae")
	)
	(text "Per device: Ron/Roff, 0.5R Kelvin R to the COM star, 10k and Zeners (about +21 V / -5.7 V) on its own Kelvin net.\nMiller hold: N-MOSFET clamp (PMV30ENEA) gate-pin to a local VEE (1u on the Kelvin pin). LAYOUT: FET + 1u at the device, loop <= 1 nH."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 306.057 140.9 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "3d684f41-191e-5f0c-bb50-23eaaa982355")
	)
	(text "S4: DESAT"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 246.522 153.4 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "4ce118ad-0a7d-50cc-bdf2-109cbc131a66")
	)
	(text "DESAT pin (internal 500 uA blanking source, trip 8.5-10.0 V) - Rs - 2 x BYG23T-M3/TR (1300 V each) - drain.\nBAT54S keeps DX between COM and VDD against dv/dt through the string; Cblk footprint DNP."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 246.522 211.24 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "6aa24192-4b52-5cc4-b9fd-8d8162377680")
	)
	(text "UCC14241-Q1, 24 V in, regulated +/-1.3 %, reinforced barrier.\nRDR: RLIM1 sources COM, RLIM2 + DLIM sink it."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 167.281 131.948 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "897dbedf-8c01-53c7-b8f8-53c4b93126dd")
	)
	(text "S4: LAYOUT RULES + MILLER MARGIN"
